@startuml rvdroid_security_testing
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam useBetaStyle true

title RVDroid Targeted Security Testing

start

:Perform static analysis of app;
note right: Identify security-sensitive methods

:Load security specifications;
note right: Method signatures, entry points, risks

:Build monitored method database;
:Plan security exploration;

fork
  :Focus on authentication flows;
  :Test with valid credentials;
  :Test with invalid credentials;
  :Test password recovery flows;
  :Test session management;
  :Test for credential storage;
fork again
  :Focus on data handling;
  :Test data input validation;
  :Test data storage security;
  :Test data transmission security;
  :Test for data leakage;
fork again
  :Focus on permissions;
  :Test permission workflows;
  :Test permission boundaries;
  :Test permission escalation;
  :Test for over-privileges;
fork again
  :Focus on crypto operations;
  :Test crypto implementations;
  :Test key management;
  :Test for weak algorithms;
  :Test for insecure parameters;
end fork

:Calculate coverage of security-sensitive methods;
:Identify missed security flows;

if (All security targets tested?) then (yes)
  :Generate comprehensive security report;
else (no)
  :Optimize exploration for missed targets;
  :Prioritize remaining security paths;
  :Continue exploration;
endif

stop

@enduml